# **Admin Panel – Complete Technical Requirements Document (TRD)**

This TRD defines a production-ready **Café Management Admin Panel** built with Next.js, React and TypeScript.

The admin panel will allow the café owner and authorized staff to manage the complete website and business operations from one centralized dashboard without editing code.

The architecture will support product/menu management, orders, customers, payments, delivery, offers, website content, analytics and business settings.

