| business_settings  | Café configuration       |
| audit_logs         | Admin activity           |
| notifications      | Dashboard notifications  |

**Important database rules:**

- Use UUID primary keys.
- Use foreign key relationships.
- Use decimal/numeric types for monetary values.
- Store timestamps in UTC.
- Add indexes to frequently queried columns.
- Use transactions for order creation and payment-related operations.
- Preserve historical order item prices.
- Never permanently delete completed order records.

